-
-## D-001@v1: 决策短标题
-- type: definition | consistency | feasibility | term | boundary | premise | architecture | compatibility | risk
-- priority: P0 | P1 | P2
-- status: accepted | unresolved | rejected | superseded
-- supersedes:
-- source: user | code | docs
